          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ugo+Bruzzo"}> Ugo Bruzzo
              , Daniel Hernandez Ruiperez,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Polishchuk"} Alexander Polishchuk
              %em Notes on fundamental algebraic supergeometry. Hilbert and Picard superschemes
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.00700"}> arXiv:2008.00700
              )
          %p
            The observation that the study of super-structures in mathematics is usefully regarded as taking place over the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/base+topos"} base topos
            on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/site"} site
